A `--record` not shaped `[namespace:]type/NNNN` is one error line at exit 1: nothing on stdout,
neither the entry nor an open item written.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
latest_migration: 9999
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/config.yaml --
macro_stubs:
  "core.macros.date +%Y-%m-%d %H:%M": "2026-10-15 15:40"
  "core.macros.date +%Y-%m-%d": "2026-10-15"
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/p/index.md --
---
title: P
---

# P
-- cmd --
booping correction add --target plans/p/index.md --step groom/draft-plan --did "proposed one plan" --said "split it" --record nonsense
-- exit --
1
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: --record must be [namespace:]type/NNNN: nonsense
